    "scenesThatPass": [
      "QUINN: You ready for your interview?\nDREW: I've prepared a color-coded itinerary based on dividing the day into fifteen minute increments alternating blue/red, double- checked the tra…",
      "QUINN: Well, Drew. I have a surprise.\nQUINN: I took the day off. I'm going into the City with you.\nDREW: What -- ?!\nQUINN: Isn't that great! We can do some shopping, have lunch, real girl stuff. Won't that be fun?",
      "QUINN: You okay?\nDREW: No... I mean, it's... impossible. I've got every minute accounted for right up to the interview. Blue and red! It won't work.\nQUINN: I just thought... you know... I've been working and we haven't had a chance to spend much time together...\nQUINN: ... and both my babies are going away to college next Fall.",
      "DREW: I'm sorry, Mom. It's really sweet of you. But don't worry. Parker will be living here with you forever since no college on earth will ever t…\nQUINN: Stop it, you two.",
      "QUINN: Come on, honey! Let's tear up Manhattan!\nDREW: You're smart. You're resourceful. You'll find a way to make it work."
    ]
